            "review_title": "Review at Bibli Library Café",
            "review_text": "Fearless20314617193\n5 contributions\n0\nExperience the Library Cafe\nApr 2026 • Friends\nI just visited Bibli Library Cafe and had a very good experience. The biggest plus is the classical-style, quiet and cosy space, suitable for concentrating work or reading. The drinking water here is tasteful, not too sweet and decorated quite eye-catching. The restaurant also serves a number of snacks such as salads and pastries, barren flavors, fresh ingredients. Overall, with such a stable price and quality of service, this is a great place to experience again.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 24, 2026",
