            "review_text": "Giangg\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nSuper nice coffee shop.\nMay 2026 • Friends\nThis cafe is really a place that everyone should try. The room is beautifully decorated and has its own vibe. Today I sat on the 2nd floor and felt the space was very fluid, and brought a little mystery, classic, and covered with many greens so create a super relaxing feeling. I looked down the first floor and saw that the restaurant also had a Harry Potter concept, so those who are fans will definitely like it, I highly recommend it. The drinks here are not only delicious but also very beautiful and refined. The staff is super friendly and cute, talking is very comfortable so I have a very comfortable feeling when sitting at the bar. I see every corner in the photo shop is beautiful, like just lifting up the camera is already a nice photo. I went to school today, but I still got some pictures. I recommended it to my friends and we will definitely come back next time. I really recommend this restaurant to everyone.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 13, 2026",
