            "review_text": "Cruiser20932577022\n1 contribution\n0\nBible\nMay 2026 • Solo\nThe restaurant has a very airy and quiet space, suitable for learning, working or relaxing with friends. As soon as you enter, you can feel a pleasant smell, creating an extremely comfortable feeling. The restaurant has 2 floors with beautiful classic style, each floor is arranged with a convenient electrical socket. A large table, long sitting is pleasant. The drinks here are quite delicious, especially my favorite is Matcha Cloud with a typical light fat and aromatic taste. In addition to drinking water, the food is also very quality, especially the shrimp punesa is extremely attractive and moderate.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten May 8, 2026",
